    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">20 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Binary search</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Parity predicate</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/single-element-in-a-sorted-array/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 540</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Single Element in a Sorted Array</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Left of the lone value, every pair starts at an even index; from it on, every pair starts at an odd index. Probe an even index and compare it with its right neighbour: equal means \"go right\", different means \"here or left\". O(log n) time, O(1) space, no XOR needed.</p>\n"
  },
